# Line endings, made deterministic.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows and built on Linux CI. Without this file the result
# depends on each machine's core.autocrlf setting, and a shell script checked out with CRLF fails
# on Linux with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M" — a confusing error a long way from its
# cause.

# Normalise to LF in the repository; check out with the platform's convention.
* text=auto

# These are executed by a shell or a container and must be LF everywhere, whatever the platform.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Binary, so git must never try to translate them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
